{"id":"9cea4880793901f3","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-provable.md","title":"有限证明序列与可证性","display":"df-provable — 有限证明序列与可证性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-provable","aliases":["18-df-provable"],"display":"df-provable — 有限证明序列与可证性","depends_on":["[[18-df-formula]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"4.1","source_printed_pages":"44–45","source_pdf_pages":"54–55","source_correspondence":"supplementary-proof-interface","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-provable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-provable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provable — 有限证明序列与可证性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"4.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"44–45"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"54–55"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"supplementary-proof-interface"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofSeq}_{\\mathcal P}(T,\\pi)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProofSeq}_{\\mathcal P}(T,\\pi)\\)</span> 为下式引入的证明序列谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a>；固定集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> 与有限元数规则集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^{(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^k}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^{(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^k}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\rangle\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> 是附加假设，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\pi\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 是有限序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(\\pi)\">\\(\\ell(\\pi)\\)</span> 表示长度；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>规则为固定元数的函数；下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in i^k\">\\(j\\in i^k\\)</span> 表示选取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 个严格早于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 的序列索引，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\pi_{j(s)}:s&lt;k\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\pi_{j(s)}:s&lt;k\\rangle\\)</span> 是对应的前提列。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProofSeq}_{\\mathcal P}(T,\\pi)\\longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\pi\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\ell(\\pi)&gt;0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;\\ell(\\pi)\\;[\n\\pi_i\\in T\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists R\\in\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\;\\exists j\\in i^k\\;\n(R:(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^k\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_S\n\\land R(\\langle\\pi_{j(s)}:s&lt;k\\rangle)=\\pi_i)].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProofSeq}_{\\mathcal P}(T,\\pi)\\longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\pi\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\ell(\\pi)&gt;0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;\\ell(\\pi)\\;[\n\\pi_i\\in T\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists R\\in\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\;\\exists j\\in i^k\\;\n(R:(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^k\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_S\n\\land R(\\langle\\pi_{j(s)}:s&lt;k\\rangle)=\\pi_i)].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi\\longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n(\\mathrm{ProofSeq}_{\\mathcal P}(T,\\pi)\\land\n\\pi_{\\ell(\\pi)-1}=\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi\\longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n(\\mathrm{ProofSeq}_{\\mathcal P}(T,\\pi)\\land\n\\pi_{\\ell(\\pi)-1}=\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>与原书 §4.1 的有限形式推导概念相对应，具体演算由参数P指定。本节点不声称任意公理/规则集合的证明检查均可判定；判定性需另给有效呈示。局部展开规则类型，避免原跨书 proof-system→rule→rule 的自依赖及不必要的编码假设。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 见 [[18-df-formula]]；固定集合 $\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 与有限元数规则集合 $\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^{(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^k}$，$\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\rangle$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProofSeq}_{\\mathcal P}(T,\\pi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^{(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell(\\pi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in i^k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\pi_{j(s)}:s<k\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProofSeq}_{\\mathcal P}(T,\\pi)\\longleftrightarrow\\;&\n\\pi\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^{<\\omega}\\land\\ell(\\pi)>0\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i<\\ell(\\pi)\\;[\n\\pi_i\\in T\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\lor\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists R\\in\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\;\\exists j\\in i^k\\;\n(R:(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^k\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_S\n\\land R(\\langle\\pi_{j(s)}:s<k\\rangle)=\\pi_i)].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi\\longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^{<\\omega}\\;\n(\\mathrm{ProofSeq}_{\\mathcal P}(T,\\pi)\\land\n\\pi_{\\ell(\\pi)-1}=\\varphi).","display":true}],"bytes":2220,"backlinks":[{"id":"ad4722aacf87aee1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$ 与 $\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}$ 见 [[18-df-provable]]；$\\bot\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 是固定矛盾句，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 是理论参数；句子见 [[18-df-sentence]]。"},{"id":"592fd98020c21e43","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MP}:(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^2\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_S$、$\\mathrm{Gen}_x:(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^1\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 是总规则函数；不匹配的 MP 输入返回逻辑真句，不产生任意结论。$\\mathcal P_S$ 采用 [[18-df-provable]] 的有限证明序列接口。$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$；$T\\vdash_S F$ 使用 $T$ 的全称闭包作为理论公理，因此变量一般化不会非法一般化未关闭的局部假设。$\\leftrightarrow$ 在公理生成式中展开为字母表定义的双条件公式。"},{"id":"98c11a88e50650e8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$、$\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}$ 见 [[18-df-provable]]；$A_{\\mathrm{PRA}},A_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 是给定的相容语言呈示。"},{"id":"b90047664466f5b8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$、$\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}$ 见 [[18-df-provable]]，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$；$\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 见 [[18-df-sentence]]。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-provable]]"},{"id":"0c5e56070c342728","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-provable]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-provable]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-81","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-provable|18-df-provable]]"}],"outgoing":["2718a8a11c383b33"]}